{
  "uid": "traces-explorer",
  "title": "Traces",
  "tags": ["platform", "traces"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
        "query": "label_values(traces_service_graph_request_total, server)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      },
      {
        "name": "minDurationMs",
        "label": "Min duration (ms)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "text": "0", "value": "0" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Trace ingest rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 1 } }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failed spans rate (5m)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(traces_service_graph_request_failed_total[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "Service graph (auto-built from spans)",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 14, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "serviceMap",
          "serviceMapQuery": "{}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans rate by service (caller)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_total{server=~\"$service\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{server}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean"] } }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "traces",
      "title": "Recent traces (TraceQL)",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 14, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && duration>${minDurationMs}ms }",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "TraceQL шпаргалка",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### TraceQL примеры\n\n| Запрос | Что делает |\n|---|---|\n| `{resource.service.name=\"auth-service\"}` | все trace'ы сервиса |\n| `{status=error}` | только error spans |\n| `{duration > 500ms}` | медленные |\n| `{name=\"POST /connect/token\"}` | конкретный endpoint |\n| `{span:db.statement=~\".*SELECT.*\"}` | все запросы к БД (Npgsql instrumentation) |\n| `{.http.route=\"/api/courses/\"}` | по ASP.NET route template |\n| `{resource.service.name=\"auth-service\" && status=error && duration>1s}` | error+slow в auth |\n\n### Корреляция signals\n\n- **Trace → Logs:** клик на span → «Logs for this span» (через `tracesToLogsV2`, см. `provisioning/datasources/datasources.yaml`)\n- **Log → Trace:** клик на `TraceID` field в Loki log entry → откроется trace в Tempo\n- **Trace → Metrics:** клик на span → «Related metrics» (RED для службы)\n\n### Service graph\n\nGenerated by Tempo `metrics_generator` — span-metrics + service-graphs пишутся в Prometheus через remote_write. Видишь дугу `auth-service → postgres` — Tempo сам её построил из span'ов."
      }
    }
  ]
}
